    "title": "Caldwell Night Rodeo hosts Man Up Crusade - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Post Register\nwebsite\nCaldwell\nCaldwell Night Rodeo hosts Man Up Crusade\nBy CBS2 News Staff,\n1 hours agoCaldwell, Idaho (CBS2) — CALDWELL, Idaho — The Caldwell Night Rodeo continued its festivities with the second night featuring the Man Up Crusade. The event, known for its vibrant atmosphere and thrilling rodeo performances, highlighted the Man Up Crusade's mission to raise awareness about domestic violence. The initiative aims to engage the rodeo community in supporting victims and promoting prevention efforts. The rodeo's commitment to this cause was evident as attendees showed their support for the campaign by wearing purple.",
